{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type DefaultedQueryObserverOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryData, TQueryKey> = WithRequired<QueryObserverOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryData, TQueryKey>, \"throwOnError\" | \"refetchOnReconnect\" | \"queryHash\">;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L662","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/types.ts:662"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryObserverOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueryObserverOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" after "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient#defaultQueryOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" has applied the\ndefaults, so "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"throwOnError"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"refetchOnReconnect"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryHash"},{"type":"text","value":" are always set."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerydata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerydata","text":"TQueryData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype DefaultedQueryObserverOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryData, TQueryKey> = WithRequired<QueryObserverOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryData, TQueryKey>, \"throwOnError\" | \"refetchOnReconnect\" | \"queryHash\">;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:662](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L662)\n\nThe [QueryObserverOptions](../interfaces/QueryObserverOptions.md) after `QueryClient#defaultQueryOptions` has applied the\ndefaults, so `throwOnError`, `refetchOnReconnect`, and `queryHash` are always set.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n### TQueryData\n\n`TQueryData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: DefaultedQueryObserverOptions\ntitle: DefaultedQueryObserverOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype DefaultedQueryObserverOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryData, TQueryKey> = WithRequired<QueryObserverOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryData, TQueryKey>, \"throwOnError\" | \"refetchOnReconnect\" | \"queryHash\">;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:662](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L662)\n\nThe [QueryObserverOptions](../interfaces/QueryObserverOptions.md) after `QueryClient#defaultQueryOptions` has applied the\ndefaults, so `throwOnError`, `refetchOnReconnect`, and `queryHash` are always set.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n### TQueryData\n\n`TQueryData` = `TQueryFnData`\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n"}
